<title>AUSTRIA: Lauda H1 96/97 pre-tax loss 142.9 mln ats.</title>
<headline>Lauda H1 96/97 pre-tax loss 142.9 mln ats.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's second largest airline Lauda Air Luftfahrt AG on Wednesday reported a pre-tax loss in the first half of 1996/1997 of 142.9 million schillings, compared with a loss of 165.6 million in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Turnover in the first six months of the year ending on October 31 rose to 1.67 billion schillings from 1.41 billion, while operating loss narrowed to 96.7 million schillings against 123 million, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
